  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n4x - 4x-1 = 24 \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 4x - 4x-1 = 24\n\n⇒ 4x - 4x/4 = 24\n\n⇒ 4x[1 - 1/4] = 24\n\n⇒ 4x × 3/4 = 24\n\n⇒ 4x = 32\n\n⇒ 22x = 2⁵\n\n⇒ 2x = 5\n\n⇒ x = 5/2\n\nValue of (2x-1)/(2x+3)= (2 times frac{5)/(2)-1}{2times (5)/(2)+3}\n\n⇒ 4/8 = 1/2\n\n**Therefore the value of expression is 1/2.**",
